+  emissions controls and stack heights for a synthetic plant so it meets every air-quality standard under five
+  years of real NOAA weather at the lowest cost, graded by EPA's AERMOD. GPT-6.1 Sol leads the four-model eval at
+  0.606 of the draft cost saved. A small first Qwen3.8-27B GRPO run did not move the score, and a larger one is
+  lined up. Play it in the
+  [Space](https://huggingface.co/spaces/Bhuminjay/PermitForge). Every rollout and the whole training run are in the
+  [dataset](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Attoloop/PermitForge).
 
